# Measure HP drain while running (vanilla). Jian HP at 0x020B4668.
load intro2
peek u16 0x020B4668 jian_hp
peek u16 0x020B466C jian_maxhp
watch u16 0x020B4668 jian_hp
press Down 60
press Right 60
peek u16 0x020B4668 hp_after_walk
press B,Up 90
press B,Left 90
press B,Down 90
press B,Right 90
press B,Up 90
press B,Left 90
press B,Down 90
press B,Right 90
shot run_end
peek u16 0x020B4668 hp_after_run
